      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03835",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "不必犹豫，只管照我的想法吧。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There is no need to hesitate; just do as I think best.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03835",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "便劝她到月光下去，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "So he urged her to go out into the moonlight,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03835",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "公主心中懊恼，坚不肯去，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but the princess was distressed and firmly refused to go,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03835",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "奈何他用力一拉，便出去了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "yet when he pulled her hard, she went out after all.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03835",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "夕雾对她说道：“我爱公主，深挚无比，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yugiri said to her, \"My love for the princess is deeper than words can say,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03835",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "请你了解我心，不须顾忌。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "please understand my heart and have no misgivings.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03835",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "若非得你同意，我决不，决不……”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Without your consent, I would never, never...\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03835",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "他的语气非常坚决。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "His tone was utterly resolute.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03835",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "谈谈说说之间，天色将近黎明了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As they talked back and forth, the sky drew close to dawn.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
